<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - People's Choice raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - People's Choice raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it upgraded People's Choice TV Corp to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 2-1/2 to 13-1/2.</p>
